<title>JAPAN: Sharp - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Sharp - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		865.36		vs	  802.73</p>
<p> Operating	   44.65		vs	   43.03</p>
<p> Current	     44.68		vs	   43.14</p>
<p> Net		   24.23		vs	   22.25</p>
<p> EPS		   21.62 yen	  vs	   19.98 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sharp Corp is a maker of consumer electronics and office automation equipment.</p>
